		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="17031"></a><b>Rithnok</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Bar Dragonfly<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/4sword.gif" alt="Patron" title="Patron" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/10594276173e81e472e3125.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 05 Jul 2002<br />Posts: 312<br />Location: Halifax, Nova Scotia</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17031&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644#17031"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Oct 02, 2003 7:42 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17031&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Stones skitter away from metal shod sollerettes as the lizard man slowly strides through the streets of Freeport. Guards of the Freeport Militia follow him just about wherever he goes. Their dark eyes staring him down as he walks around. Three men always watching him as he walks looking up every so often to gaze at the residences.
<br />

<br />
The soldiers of the militia never move to stop him nor to get in his way for they have tangled with him once before and when they did their numbers were whittled down as he and a cleric of Marr fought against them. Odd one would think, that the militia would try to kill a man like himself considering his path being an iksar would much resemble theirs. Unfortunately for them, it was their luck to try and kill the only Iksar of Mithaniel Marr. They found very quickly that his skill with blade and bow were ages and beyond some of the most deadly skills they had come across even their leader Sir Lucan De'lere had fallen to his blades. As it was now, Lucan was nursing his wounds.
<br />

<br />
But being smart, the leader of the Freeport militia had ordered the FP Militia not to attack him, but merely to watch and should the samurai get into a battle to bring a report back of his motions in combat so he could study them. <span style="font-style: italic">A smart man indeed.</span> Thought Rithnok as he stopped before a small house. He looked down to the directions he took from the board in the Kindred Spirits and then to the house... "I guess this must be the place..." He smiled to himself as he raised a single gauntleted scaled hand and knocked on the door.
<br />

<br />
After a few moments a young human man opened the door looking at him a little shocked to see a lizard man at his door. He smiled and bowed respectfully. "Good day to you m'lord, I am Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer. A friend to the Concordat. Might I ask for a few moments of your day?" He smiled and stood there waiting for the man's responce.
<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
<br />
High Guardian Of Veeshan
<br />
White Lotus Samurai of the 65th Rank
<br />
Zen Cabal
<br />
Test Server</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
