				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Arriik smiled as he realized who wa speaking.
<br />

<br />
"Thou must be Rithnok.  I have hear of thee."  The young paladin stepped aside.  "Enter freely, freind."
<br />

<br />
Arriik showed the Iksar to a chair, noting that he had none with backs that could accomodate the lizardman's long tail.  He made a mental note to obtain one, even noting which chair he would discard in favor of it.  "Can I get thee any refreshment?"</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
