				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">A dark figure slips through the Freeport City streets and slowly makes his way into North Freeport, where he has a lower chance of having his head handed to him by some guard. He steps from the shadows, tall and proud, his scaled tail twitching back and forth. The iksar, clad in various leather and monk specific armor, holds his hand up to a passing Knight of Truth. The knight warily approaches the lizard and eyes him up and down, and despite the iksar's reputation, the guard obviously is nervous. Drakanos looks at the guard with empty eyes, and asks him a relatively simple question. "Have you seen another Iksar enter this place? Slightly taller than I, most likely wearing Plated or Chainmail armor." The knight nods and directs the lizardman to an abandoned shop that recently came into the posession of a young Paladin of Marr. He salutes the knight and swiftly begins running across the North Quadrant of Freeport in the general direction of the mentioned abandoned shop.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
