				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Arriik tries to cover his surprise at the Ik. . . Dragon's provacative offer.  He does not belive he does a very good job.  Of course, there can be only one answer.
<br />

<br />
"I would be grateful for any assistance thou could provide, Freind."  The young paladin smiles.  "I believe I've already learned more in the last few minutes then I have in the past year, even venturing with the Wayfarer's.  And, of course, any help in any respect is greatly appreciated, by me and the Concordat.  Art thou certain thou dost not require anything else in return for thy aid?  If it is mine to give, I would do so gladly."</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
