				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The samurai smiles, "Now, Would I be considered the Dragon I am if I required something for everything I did for others? I think not. Besides," He takes a long draw from his mug of water. "I Do believe we both are working towards the same goal. The preservation of the natural balance of things. So in that, by helping the concordat with it's goals, also helps with my goals. So in turn you have given me what I have sought after... Friendship. And That my lord paladin, is, what I truly desire in life." The samurai bows his head respectfully as he finishes his mug of water.
<br />

