		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17043&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644#17043"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Oct 06, 2003 9:59 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17043&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The samurai smiles and stands returning the bow, before he takes note to readjust his blades upon his body. "By the way, I think the paladins might want to know. Sir Lucan De'lere will be alone tonight. Something about having more guards than usual on the gates. Something's got him worried. I sure hope it isn't me." He smiles brightly and picks up his backpack, "You'll have to excuse me m'lord, there is much for this samurai to do before I return to the Kindred Spirits I shall be making my way over to SkyShrine. Lord Yelinak has requested my presence in the Ice Lair." He offers a hand which is taken by the Paladin and he shakes it firmly.
<br />

<br />
"So until next we meet good Lord we will have to have a drink back at the spirits. I will keep messages comming to the Kindred Spirits by way of Cobalt Drake. I think the High elves are getting kind of used to Indranos. And again m'lord, thank you very much for the mug of water and your kind hospitality." He smiles and bows his head as he makes his way out the door and into the streets of North Freeport. He stop just after closing the door and taking one step. His nostrals flare for a second before his eyes look around, One of the paladin guards stops shooting Rithnok a sidelong glance before turning and walking over, "Is there a problem Samurai?" He turns his head to regard the guard, "Oh, no good sir, not at all I am just wondering when my friend will leave the shadows and reveal himself." He smiles as the guard begins to scan the shadows and places a hand upon his sword.
<br />

<br />
Rithnok chuckles, "worry not, he is friend. Not Enemy." He looks around and just speaks to the air, "Is that not right m'lord Drakanos?"
<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
<br />
High Guardian Of Veeshan
<br />
White Lotus Samurai of The 65Th Rank
<br />
Zen Cabal
<br />
Test Server</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
