			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Drakanos's eyes glint from the darkness as he darts out from an alley, his arms crossed. He grins and uncrosses his arms. "I was wondering when you'd leave, shogun Tatsukao." Drakanos glances to the Guard. "As you were, Hallis." Sir Hallis nods, and continues his patrol down the street. "So, Rithnok, what is your business in Freeport this day?" Drakanos thinks for a moment. "Visiting someone?" Drakanos leans on his stave.<br />_________________<br /><img src="http://reconsoutpost.homestead.com/files/images/blackfist.gif" border="0" />
<br />
<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=481180" target="_blank" class="postlink">Drakanos Shuurai</a>, Monk of the 55th Rung, Master of the Swift Tail Caste</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
