				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17046&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644#17046"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Oct 08, 2003 3:59 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17046&amp;sid=d38238639cbf55bd6cf3c1beae19c644"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Drakanos nods to Rithnok. "I will do what I can. The Giants of Kael Drakkal are no allies of mine." Drakanos spins his staff around in one hand and stabs it into the loose dirt at his feet. "By the way ... could you put in a good word with Lord Yelinak for me?" Drakanos grins wryly. "I will aid the Concordat in their endeavors. But tell me, whom is this new guild leader? Someone I know, hopefully." Drakanos glances at the house from which he saw Rithnok leave.<br />_________________<br /><img src="http://reconsoutpost.homestead.com/files/images/blackfist.gif" border="0" />
<br />
